Package: modelskill
Type: Package
Title: Quantitative Model Skill Diagrams and Indices
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: person("Alexandre M.J.-C.", "Wadoux",
    email = "alexandre.wadoux@yahoo.fr",
    role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"))
Description: Evaluates quantitative prediction models using map- and model-skill
    indices together with Taylor, solar, and target diagrams. The implementation
    follows Wadoux, Walvoort, and Brus (2022) <doi:10.1016/j.geoderma.2021.115332>.
